Value Required LOCAL_PORT (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (.+?)
Value PORT_DESC (.*?)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (.*?)
Value SYSTEM_DESC (.*?)
Value MGMT_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)

Start
  ^Port\s+:\s+\S+\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^Port\s+:\s+${LOCAL_PORT}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Chassis-Name\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_NAME}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Chassis-Description\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_DESC}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Chassis-ID\s+:\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Management-Address\s+:\s+${MGMT_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Port-ID\s+:\s+${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^Neighbor Port-Desc\s+:\s+${PORT_DESC}\s*$$
